{"slug":"top-dawg-entertainment-hosted-a-private-screening-of-money-bags-visual-ep","postId":74311,"title":"Top Dawg Entertainment Hosted A Private Screening Of 'Money Bags' Visual EP","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":513948,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/258767579_424836855787052_4698254844089633772_n-680x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-513948\"/><figcaption>Courtesy of Punch's Instagram </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Thursday night, Top Dawg Entertainment had a private screening of A Room Full of Mirrors, a collective of projects consisting of&nbsp;TDE's Punch,&nbsp;Nick Grant, DayLyt, Early Riser, and Billymarie, Lyric Michelle, Ichiban Don, Hari, and Jrias Law. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Rapbasement, they have already released a couple of <a href=\"https://www.rapbasement.com/featured/tdes-punch-announces-a-room-full-of-mirrors-collective-money-bags-visual-ep.html?fr=operanews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">songs</a> off the project. Now, they are making a statement with the release of the Money Bag Visual.<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/tv/CWcGs2Epxqh/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tv/CWcGs2Epxqh/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to TDE's Punch, the private screen was a success, and he spent most of the night taking in the moment. He also took the time to acknowledge and thank the people that were a part of the project and who helped put on the private screening event.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Punch wrote on his Instagram page, Lyric Michelle, \"you completely nail it with the writing and directing the film. Crazy thing is that was only your first one. Scary.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was also the directorial debut of <a href=\"https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/tdes-punch-drops-off-pay-no-attention-to-the-man-behind-the-curtain-new-song.1987029.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ARFOM’s own Lyric Michelle</a>, who also pulled double duty as one of the featured artists as well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure you also check out MIRRORS reflecting on the making of the MONEY BAGS below.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/_pqkRiPxPFg\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/_pqkRiPxPFg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->","excerpt":"Courtesy of Punch's Instagram On Thursday night, Top Dawg Entertainment had a private screening of A Room Full of Mirrors, a collective of projects consisting of TDE's Punch, Nick Grant, DayLyt,…","publishedAt":"2021-11-20T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2021-11-20T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"entertainment","name":"Entertainment"},{"slug":"music","name":"Music"},{"slug":"news","name":"News"}],"tags":[{"slug":"billymarie","name":"Billymarie"},{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"daylyt","name":"DayLyt"},{"slug":"earlee-riser","name":"Earlee Riser"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"hari","name":"Hari"},{"slug":"ichiban-don","name":"Ichiban Don"},{"slug":"lyric-michelle","name":"Lyric Michelle"},{"slug":"money-bag","name":"Money Bag"},{"slug":"of-a-room-full-of-mirrors","name":"of A Room Full of Mirrors"},{"slug":"on-thursday-night","name":"On Thursday night"},{"slug":"punch","name":"Punch"},{"slug":"tde","name":"TDE"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/258767579_424836855787052_4698254844089633772_n-680x1024.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/258767579_424836855787052_4698254844089633772_n-680x1024.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/top-dawg-entertainment-hosted-a-private-screening-of-money-bags-visual-ep/"}